{"seq":4,"slug":"major-events","title":"穆斯塔法·凯末尔·重大历史事件","stage":"DONE","category":"mustafa-kemal-ataturk","categoryLabel":"穆斯塔法·凯末尔","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/major-events","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/21_mustafa-kemal-ataturk/4_major-events","introHtml":"<p>把凯末尔的一生压缩成几个决定性的时刻，是理解他最快的路径。这个侧面不铺陈完整的生平年表，而是把镜头对准三个里程碑式的关口：1915 年的加里波利防御战让一名 34 岁的上校一战成名；1919 至 1923 年的民族独立战争把濒临瓜分的旧帝国残骸重铸为一个独立共和国；1928 年的字母改革则以一场文化革命，把这个新国家的面孔彻底转向西方。每一个事件都有清晰的对手、明确的时间节点与可核验的战役数字——它们不是背景，而是改写历史走向的转折点本身。</p>\n<p>它面向的是想抓住「关键节点」而非通读全部细节的历史读者。每一篇都尽量给出具体日期、战役名称、参战番号与伤亡数字，让宏大叙事落在可追溯的事实上，而不是停留在「他很伟大」的抽象赞颂。</p>\n<p>它与兄弟侧面分工明确：<a href=\"../life-and-career/\">生平与事业</a>叙述从萨洛尼卡少年到共和国缔造者的完整时间线；<a href=\"../core-policies/\">核心政策</a>讲他执政后推行的世俗化与现代化制度；<a href=\"../political-thought/\">政治思想</a>梳理「凯末尔主义」六支箭的内在逻辑；<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与历史地位</a>评估他留给土耳其与世界的长远遗产；<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>直面强人手段与少数族群问题的追问。本侧面不重复这些「是什么」与「该如何评判」，而专门定格那几个「在哪一刻改变了一切」的瞬间。</p>\n<p>三章依次展开：<a href=\"gallipoli/\">加里波利</a>讲他如何在达达尼尔海峡的滩头与高地之间从军官跃升为民族英雄；<a href=\"the-independence-war/\">独立战争</a>追踪从拒绝《色佛尔条约》到《洛桑条约》赢得国际承认的立国四年；<a href=\"the-alphabet-reform/\">字母改革</a>则呈现他用拉丁字母替换阿拉伯字母、以一场自上而下的文化革命重塑国民认同的过程。</p>\n<p>读这三章时不妨留意一条贯穿始终的线索：凯末尔每一次的成功，都是「先用事实造成既成局面、再让对手不得不承认」——加里波利如此，独立战争如此，连字母改革也是如此。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gallipoli","title":"Gallipoli","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/major-events/gallipoli","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-defense-of-gallipoli","title":"加里波利防御战","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/major-events/gallipoli/the-defense-of-gallipoli"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-making-of-a-hero","title":"一位英雄的塑造","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/major-events/gallipoli/the-making-of-a-hero"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-independence-war","title":"The Independence War","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/major-events/the-independence-war","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"resisting-partition","title":"抵抗瓜分","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/major-events/the-independence-war/resisting-partition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"victory-and-the-republic","title":"胜利与共和国的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/major-events/the-independence-war/victory-and-the-republic"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"the-alphabet-reform","title":"The Alphabet Reform","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/major-events/the-alphabet-reform","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-latin-alphabet","title":"拉丁字母改革","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/major-events/the-alphabet-reform/the-latin-alphabet"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-cultural-revolution","title":"一场全方位的文化革命","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mustafa-kemal-ataturk/major-events/the-alphabet-reform/the-cultural-revolution"}]}]}